# Frontend configuration. Copy to `.env` and adjust; `.env` is gitignored.
#
# Only variables prefixed with VITE_ reach the browser bundle — and everything
# in that bundle is public. Never put secrets or API keys here.

# Base URL of the Django API.
# Leave empty in development: Vite proxies /api to http://localhost:8000
# (see vite.config.ts). Set it for builds served from another origin,
# e.g. VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
